    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃、リハーサルよかったぞ\r\nグルメ番組に出るのは初めてだけど、この調子なら……",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ってどうした、表情が暗いぞ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "その……よくわからなくって……\r\nどうして私が番組のオーディションに受かったんでしょう？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "食レポ、上手くできたって思えませんでした……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃には、見ている人を癒す力があるからじゃないかな",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "人を癒す力……ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、番組ディレクターからも、\r\nちまちま食べてるところが可愛かったって言われたしね",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ディレクターの評価も高いってことだよ\r\n今の調子でみんなを癒していこう",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも……私、人の癒し方なんて全然わからないです\r\nどうすればいいんでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ちゃんと人を癒やせないと、\r\n番組ディレクターさんの期待にも応えられないですよねっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自然体だからこそ、できることもあるんだ\r\n人を癒すなんて考えなくていいんだよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "自然体に、考えない……\r\nほわっ、よけいに意識しちゃいますっ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030080"
  },
  {
    "select": "鳥に話しかける\r\nつもりで……",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "まずは深呼吸を",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "料理を楽しもう",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、ピーちゃんに話すみたいに食レポしてみたらどうかな\r\nそれなら普通に話をしてる気持ちになれるんじゃないか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "普通に話す……\r\n本当にそれだけでいいんでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そういう自然体な真乃の何気ない日常会話にこそ\r\n癒されたりするんだよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そうだったんですね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "全然意識していませんでした\r\nなんてことのない会話に癒される人も……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "もし本当に誰かを癒やせてるなら\r\n私、うれしいですっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、いつもの自然体でみんなを癒してくれ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "やってみます\r\nピーちゃんに話しかけるつもりで",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ、そうだっ\r\nピーちゃんもいいですけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん、どうした？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "鳥さんだけじゃなくて、他の人とも気負わず\r\n自然体で話せるようにならないとですよねっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "だから、プロデューサーさんに話しかけるつもりで\r\nやってみますっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "自然体になるよう、頑張りますね\r\nむんっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（力んだら意味ないんだけど……\r\nま、あの調子なら大丈夫かな）",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そ、そうですね\r\n大きく息を吸って吐いて",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "すぅ～はぁ～すぅ～はぁ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ？　どうしてプロデューサーさん、\r\nニコニコしてるんでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "深呼吸する真乃の仕草がよかったから",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030210,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ？　でも深呼吸の時しませんか？\r\n両手を広げて～すぅ～はぁ～すぅ～はぁ～こんなふうに",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃だから可愛く見えたんだね\r\n癒されたよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そ、そう言われたら恥ずかしいです～",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今みたいに何気ないことで\r\nみんな癒されるんだよ、真乃の場合",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ、そうなんですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから癒さなくっちゃって気負う必要はないんだ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつもどおりいつもどおり\r\nそれが真乃の場合はいい",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030240,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい、わかりましたっ\r\nありがとうございます、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、本番の前にもう一回深呼吸しておこうか",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030250,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\nすぅ～はぁ～すぅ～はぁ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030260,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも……食レポが大変で楽しむ余裕なんて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "美味しそうに食べてるように見えたけど\r\n料理の味もよくわからなかったかな？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030270,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "いいえ、すごーく美味しかったですっ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030280,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "海老は大きくてプリプリでしたし、\r\nサラダの野菜は新鮮シャキシャキでしたっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "良かったよ、楽しめてて\r\nその調子で食レポもすればいいんだよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030290,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "今みたいなのでいいんでしょうか？\r\n普通に感想を言っただけです……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だよ\r\n真乃の素直な反応は見てて癒されるからね",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030300,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……そうだったんですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030310,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "じゃあ、素直に料理を楽しみますっ\r\nプロデューサーさんのおかげでホッとしました",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、その調子で気楽に行けばいい",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030320,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふ……気が楽になったら\r\n早くお料理を食べたいなぁ、って思えてきました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030320"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001030330,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "食レポ、頑張りますね\r\nむんっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100103/1001001030330"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]